// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_GV_Grillo_Mission_3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WarhulkTech 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3702703389" "Salvaged Warhulk Tech"
// DetailString :
"P1097926739" "These are tech components taken from Nemesis Warhulks. Operative Grillo hopes to use these samples to unlock the secrets of Nemesis technology."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P632180277" "Nemesis. I'd consider him and his troops comical if they weren't so deadly. Underneath their brass-plated armor you'll sometimes find technology more advanced than even Arachnos can produce. The Warhulks in particular are of interest to Arachnos, so much so that we'd like to learn more about them. Of course, this involves engaging the Warhulks, destroying them, and getting tech samples from them. We've received word that Nemesis is raiding one of the local warehouses for supplies, and that their assault team includes a number of Warhulks.  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Intercept the Nemesis troops and collect tech samples from the Warhulks!</A><br><br>This warehouse raid is typical of their resupply tactics, a simple hit-and-run. <color orange>You'll have 75 minutes before they escape!</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P178275574" "Collect tech from Warhulks"
// SendOffString :
"P1661663880" "If we can unlock the secrets of the Nemesis technology, we'll be unstoppable!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4267855424" "The Warhulks won't hang around the warehouse forever. Move!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
