"P589496792" "We must of course always protect the interest of our Arachnos technicians. One of them apparently has gone missing, and there have been reports of movements beneath the floor grates. We've done some scanning and found a tunnel entrance nearby the office. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go in there and find what's crawling around beneath the base!</A>"
